<p class="lh">Digital transformation has become a strategic necessity, yet many organizations still struggle to understand where they stand and what to prioritize next. This infographic presents a practical maturity model that helps leadership teams benchmark current capability across strategy, technology, data, governance, and operating rhythm. Instead of treating transformation as a single program milestone, the visual frames it as a staged progression with clear capability signals and decision triggers.</p>

<p class="lh">The model is designed for real-world planning conversations between CIOs, transformation offices, enterprise architects, and business executives. It addresses a common challenge in board-level reviews: teams can describe initiatives underway, but cannot consistently show maturity level, institutional readiness, or pathways to higher value realization. The infographic bridges that gap with a structured lens for diagnosis and roadmap sequencing.</p>

